<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>智信科目一、科目二区域三维地图</name><description><![CDATA[<h3>使用说明</h3><p>导入后开启 Google Earth 的地形显示。边界采用用户提供的 GNSS/WGS84 坐标。</p><p>建筑、树木、设备及判读点没有可靠高度测量，均保持贴地显示，不生成虚构三维高度。需要精细模型时应补充无人机倾斜摄影、点云或测量数据。</p><p>内置卫星影像为 Esri / Vantor / Earthstar Geographics / GIS User Community，元数据日期 2017-07-24，标称分辨率 0.5 米。</p>]]></description><Style id="boundary"><LineStyle><color>ff00ffff</color><width>4</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>2600ffff</color></PolyStyle></Style><Style id="point"><IconStyle><color>ff00ffff</color><scale>0.65</scale></IconStyle><LabelStyle><color>ffffffff</color><scale>0.8</scale></LabelStyle></Style><Style id="observation"><IconStyle><color>ff55ccff</color><scale>1</scale></IconStyle></Style><Style id="road"><LineStyle><color>ff66d9ff</color><width>3</width></LineStyle></Style><Style id="power"><LineStyle><color>ff5577ff</color><width>4</width></LineStyle></Style><Style id="elevation"><IconStyle><color>ff40c0ff</color><scale>0.45</scale></IconStyle><LabelStyle><scale>0</scale></LabelStyle></Style><open>1</open><LookAt><longitude>113.709023</longitude><latitude>33.864222</latitude><altitude>0</altitude><heading>0</heading><tilt>45</tilt><range>1700</range><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode></LookAt><Folder><name>一、竞赛边界（WGS84）</name><open>1</open><Placemark><name>科目一、科目二区域边界</name><description><![CDATA[<h3>竞赛边界</h3><p>25 个 GNSS/WGS84 边界点；水平面积约 51.23 公顷，周长约 4.104 千米。</p>]]></description><styleUrl>#boundary</styleUrl><Polygon><tessellate>1</tessellate><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>113.70741944,33.86434444,0 113.70589722,33.86421944,0 113.70581944,33.86480556,0 113.70532222,33.86476944,0 113.70540000,33.86416667,0 113.70383333,33.86402500,0 113.70373889,33.86281389,0 113.70356667,33.86095000,0 113.70715000,33.86063056,0 113.70729167,33.86243611,0 113.70743333,33.86241389,0 113.70861111,33.86235556,0 113.70856944,33.8619416