TA[<h3>P21</h3>WGS84 坐标：113.71019722°E，33.86801667°N<br>原始边界点序号：21]]></description><styleUrl>#point</styleUrl><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.71019722,33.86801667,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>P22</name><description><![CDATA[<h3>P22</h3>WGS84 坐标：113.71010556°E，33.86950556°N<br>原始边界点序号：22]]></description><styleUrl>#point</styleUrl><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.71010556,33.86950556,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>P23</name><description><![CDATA[<h3>P23</h3>WGS84 坐标：113.70786944°E，33.86926111°N<br>原始边界点序号：23]]></description><styleUrl>#point</styleUrl><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.70786944,33.86926111,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>P24</name><description><![CDATA[<h3>P24</h3>WGS84 坐标：113.70770556°E，33.86573056°N<br>原始边界点序号：24]]></description><styleUrl>#point</styleUrl><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.70770556,33.86573056,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>P25</name><description><![CDATA[<h3>P25</h3>WGS84 坐标：113.70757500°E，33.86436667°N<br>原始边界点序号：25]]></description><styleUrl>#point</styleUrl><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.70757500,33.86436667,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Folder><Folder><name>二、卫星影像判读点（非实测设备）</name><Placemark><name>A · 东侧农田与田间通道</name><description><![CDATA[<h3>A · 东侧农田与田间通道</h3>成片条带状种植纹理，田界及通道清晰，代表点位于 P19—P16 西侧。<br><b>待核实：</b>作物种类、株高、田埂落差、地表承载条件未知；细小电线不能凭此影像排除。<br><small>2017-07-24 卫星影像人工判读，未实测</small>]]></description><styleUrl>#observation</styleUrl><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.71137843,33.86420168,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>B · 中部密集树木带</name><description><![CDATA[<h3>B · 中部密集树木带</h3>可见连续树冠及规则栽植纹理，呈南北向长条分布。<br><b>待核实：</b>树种、树高和当前范围未知；不能把该带视为无障碍空地。<br><small>2017-07-24 卫星影像人工判读，未实测</small>]]></description><styleUrl>#observation</styleUrl><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.70889013,33.86377122,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>C · 北侧浅色场地与矩形构筑物</name><description><![CDATA[<h3>C · 北侧浅色场地与矩形构筑物</h3>P22—P23 南侧为大块浅色地表，中部可见矩形设施及其投影。<br><b>待核实：</b>用途无法确认；是否存在围栏、桩柱、活动设备及其高度需现场查证。<br><small>2017-07-24 卫星影像人工判读，未实测</small>]]></description><styleUrl>#observation</styleUrl><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.70899381,33.86863525,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>D · 北部规则分格地块</name><description><![CDATA[<h3>D · 北部规则分格地块</h3>主通道东侧可见规则小方格、条形设施和少量蓝色屋面。<br><b>待核实：</b>可能为种植或试验性地块，具体用途未确认；不作比赛设备命名。<br><small>2017-07-24 卫星影像人工判读，未实测</small>]]></description><styleUrl>#observation</styleUrl><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.70899381,33.86631088,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>E · 北部深色矩形池状地物</name><description><![CDATA[<h3>E · 北部深色矩形池状地物</h3>规则矩形深色面，边缘较直，邻近条状设施；影像上疑似池塘或水池。<br><b>待核实：</b>水深、池壁高度、是否蓄水及用途均未知；需确认是否为真实水面。<br><small>2017-07-24 卫星影像人工判读，未实测</small>]]></description><styleUrl>#observation</styleUrl><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.70873461,33.86719760,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>F · 西南侧建筑与硬化通道</name><description><![CDATA[<h3>F · 西南侧建筑与硬化通道</h3>P6—P10 内侧可见小型屋面、成片绿化及规则或弯曲通道。<br><b>待核实：</b>建筑用途、屋面高度、围栏和开放状态未知；不能据影像判定起降条件。<br><small>2017-07-24 卫星影像人工判读，未实测</small>]]></description><styleUrl>#observation</styleUrl><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.70598711,33.86291030,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>G · 西南侧池塘与混合地表</name><description><![CDATA[<h3>G · 西南侧池塘与混合地表</h3>P8 东北侧可见深色不规则池状地物，周围为裸地、低矮植被及小路。<br><b>待核实：</b>水位、岸线软硬、排水能力及季节变化未知。<br><small>2017-07-24 卫星影像人工判读，未实测</small>]]></description><styleUrl>#observation</styleUrl><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.70396537,33.86144672,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>H · 西北侧椭圆跑道状场地（区域外）</name><description><![CDATA[<h3>H · 西北侧椭圆跑道状场地（区域外）</h3>P23 西南方向的边界外可见椭圆环形道及内部场地。<br><b>待核实：</b>仅作周边参照，不纳入本次竞赛边界；不能由外形确认机构或场地名称。<br><small>2017-07-24 卫星影像人工判读，未实测</small>]]></description><styleUrl>#observation</styleUrl><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.70619447,33.86839421,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Folder><Folder><name>三、公开地图道路与电力记录</name><Placemark><name>输电杆塔（区域外）</name><description><![CDATA[<h3>输电杆塔（区域外）</h3>区域外；距边界约 349 米<br>OSM 标签：power=tower<br><a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/7380756797">打开原始记录</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#power</styleUrl><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.71580240,33.85885870,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>110 kV 架空输电线路（区域外）（线段 1）</name><description><![CDATA[<h3>110 kV 架空输电线路（区域外）（线段 1）</h3>区域外；距边界约 337 米<br>OSM 标签：cables=3；frequency=50；power=line；voltage=110000<br><a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/787547249">打开原始记录</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#power</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.71759919,33.86048924,0 113.71728030,33.86020170,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>110 kV 架空输电线路（区域外）（线段 2）</name><description><![CDATA[<h3>110 kV 架空输电线路（区域外）（线段 2）</h3>区域外；距边界约 337 米<br>OSM 标签：cables=3；frequency=50；power=line；voltage=110000<br><a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/787547249">打开原始记录</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#power</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.71728030,33.86020170,0 113.71580240,33.85885870,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark><Placemark><name>110 kV 架空输电线路（区域外）（线段 3）</name><description><![CDATA[<h3>110 kV 架空输电线路（区域外）（线段 3）</h3>区域外；距边界约 337 米<br>OSM 标签：cables=3；frequency=50；power=line；voltage=110000<br><a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/787547249">打开原始记录</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#power</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</